## Layer boundaries (do not mix)

Repo structure (rules of authority):

- **`src/irswitch/iracing/`**: data extraction only (shared memory polling/parsing). **No business logic.**
- **`src/irswitch/obs/`**: thin OBS client wrapper. **No policy / no decisions.**
- **`src/irswitch/logic/`**: state machine + decision rules only. **Single decision path for scene switching.**
- **`src/irswitch/server/`**: HTTP/WebSocket/API glue. **Never drives logic directly.**
- **No TUI**: `irswitch_tui` / Textual was removed. Do not reintroduce it. Dashboards are HTTP (`/gr-status`, `/vr-status`).

## State machine constraints

- Transitions must be **explicit** and **testable**.
- No hidden side effects inside getters.
- Cooldowns/debounce must be **time-based** (monotonic), not “frame-based”.

## Integration principle

All scene switches go through **one decision pipeline** (policy/state machine),
so the reason is explainable and testable.

